# Objective 2: every kind of syntax error, all reported in ONE run thanks to
# panic-mode recovery, each with a line number and the tokens that were expected.
SUBJECT admin, guest
RESOURCE database SUPPORTS READ, WRITE

ALLOW admin DELETE database              # expect: P001  DELETE is not an action
DENY guest WRITE                         # expect: P001  the resource is missing
ALLOW admin READ database WHEN (mfa      # expect: P001  the ')' is missing
ALLOW guest READ database;               # expect: L001  ';' is not part of the language
allow guest READ database                # expect: P001  keywords are uppercase
ALLOW admin READ database WHEN           # expect: P001  the condition is empty
